{"id":"n87881-1-7","stage":5,"title":"흐느끼다 · 抽泣","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87881-1-7-1","ko":"대회에서 민준이가 우승을 했다며?","zh":"听说敏俊赢了比赛？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대회에서","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대회에서","audio":"/audio/64809cf7f009971e77c5.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"우승을","meaning":"冠军，第一名","explanation":"우승：冠军，第一名；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우승","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69495","senseId":"1","lemma":"우승","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우승을","audio":"/audio/a14a4028e32f2f2aa8d0.mp3"}},{"text":"했다며?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했다며","audio":"/audio/17f6aceb9316e09a99bf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"31e52393f3eb0c17","term":"우승","zh":"冠军，第一名","audio":"/audio/31e52393f3eb0c171420.mp3","entryId":"69495","definition":"在比赛中全部战胜对方，获得第一。","pronunciation":["우승"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7fb591a7e6636ff9602.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87881-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 감격을 했는지 흐느끼면서 울더라고.","zh":"是啊，他大概太激动了，一直在抽泣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"감격을","meaning":"激动，感慨","explanation":"감격：激动，感慨；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"감격","audio":"/audio/6da4d64cec5019682252.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15253","senseId":"1","lemma":"감격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감격을","audio":"/audio/850b9cabc564f25839f5.mp3"}},{"text":"했는지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했는지","audio":"/audio/8ea70c8c116e867b73a0.mp3"}},{"text":"흐느끼면서","meaning":"抽泣，抽搭","explanation":"흐느끼다：抽泣，抽搭；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"흐느끼다","audio":"/audio/c8811f062ddf22aa7c5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87881","senseId":"1","lemma":"흐느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐느끼면서","audio":"/audio/14d19f2ec51f297ad767.mp3"}},{"text":"울더라고.","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울더라고","audio":"/audio/45059c677809d2f3b81d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"6da4d64cec501968","term":"감격","zh":"激动，感慨","audio":"/audio/6da4d64cec5019682252.mp3","entryId":"15253","definition":"内心深深地感受到，非常感动；或指那种感动。","pronunciation":["감ː격"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c8811f062ddf22aa","term":"흐느끼다","zh":"抽泣，抽搭","audio":"/audio/c8811f062ddf22aa7c5c.mp3","entryId":"87881","definition":"因非常悲伤或激动而勉强能发出声音哭泣。","pronunciation":["흐느끼다"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd5100dfff138e0110f1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.406,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87881","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2327,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说敏俊赢了比赛？","是啊，他大概太激动了，一直在抽泣。","你看起来和男朋友关系真好啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说敏俊赢了比赛？","是啊，他大概太激动了，一直在抽泣。","你看起来和男朋友关系真好啊？"],"answer":1}]}
